# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0172.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Backend -> buf_table hash
buf_table hash -> buffer 1: "hit: pin, bump usagecount"
buf_table hash -> clock-sweep strategy: miss
clock-sweep strategy -> buffer 0: pick victim
clock-sweep strategy -> data files on disk: load
data files on disk -> buffer 0: page in
buffer 1 -> "each descriptor: tag · buf_id ·": described by
checkpointer / bgwriter -> data files on disk: flush dirty

Buffer manager — bufmgr.c { buf_table hash, clock-sweep strategy }
Buffer cache in shared memory — NBuffers slots of 32KB { buffer 0, buffer 1, buffer N-1 }
